    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478260/extras/af264d4a2b92fcfbc39ca26f50766bc7.poster.avif?t=1740492705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478260/extras/af264d4a2b92fcfbc39ca26f50766bc7.webm?t=1740492705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><strong>City of Rampage</strong> is an intense 2D action-brawler inspired by such <strong>SEGA</strong> Classics as<i><strong> </strong></i> <strong><i>&quot;Comix Zone&quot;</i></strong><i> and <strong>&quot;Streets of Rage&quot;</strong></i>, with advanced fighting mechanics, with challenging tough enemies and even tougher bosses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful hand-drawn graphics and dope soundtracks will make sure you will enjoy every moment of your struggle through <strong>City of Rampage</strong>!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478260/extras/af264d4a2b92fcfbc39ca26f50766bc7.poster.avif?t=1740492705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478260/extras/af264d4a2b92fcfbc39ca26f50766bc7.webm?t=1740492705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><strong>City of Rampage</strong> is an intense 2D action-brawler inspired by such <strong>SEGA</strong> Classics as<i><strong> </strong></i> <strong><i>&quot;Comix Zone&quot;</i></strong><i> and <strong>&quot;Streets of Rage&quot;</strong></i>, with advanced fighting mechanics, with challenging tough enemies and even tougher bosses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful hand-drawn graphics and dope soundtracks will make sure you will enjoy every moment of your struggle through <strong>City of Rampage</strong>!</p>",
